        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Typing Challenge]: The Ultimate Typing Challenge</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Typing Challenge]</strong> is an addictive arcade typing challenge designed to push your <strong>typing accuracy, reaction speed, and multitasking abilities</strong> to their absolute limit. Type swiftly and accurately to climb the global leaderboards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>1. Normal Mode: Test Your Split-Focus Skills</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Normal Mode serves as the ultimate test of your <strong>independent two-hand typing skills</strong>. Two separate lanes appear on the screen, and you must simultaneously and instantly type the characters descending in both lanes.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dual-Lane System</strong>: The <strong>left lane</strong> features characters found on the left side of the keyboard. The <strong>right lane</strong> features characters from the right side of the keyboard.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Over Condition</strong>: The game ends immediately if you fail to type the characters in <strong>even a single lane</strong>, allowing them to reach the bottom of the screen.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Difficulty Escalation</strong>: As the level progresses, both the <strong>number of characters</strong> and the <strong>speed</strong> at which they appear increase dramatically.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Challenge</strong>: See how high you can score by combining <strong>typing precision</strong>, <strong>raw speed</strong>, and superior <strong>multitasking ability</strong> to manage both simultaneous threats.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>2. Snake Mode: Precision and Stamina</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Snake Mode introduces a unique typing experience where characters are <strong>respawned sequentially, much like a crawling snake</strong>. Maintaining a clean, fast typing flow is paramount in this intense mode.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Continuous Respawn</strong>: Characters are linked and continuously respawn, requiring you to maintain an unbroken typing stream.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scaling Density</strong>: As the level advances, the <strong>size and total count of the character chains</strong> significantly increase, quickly overwhelming the screen.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Ultimate Test</strong>: Push your ability to maintain <strong>precise and rapid typing pace</strong> and test how long you can sustain that level of <strong>focus and stamina</strong>.</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Typing Challenge]: The Ultimate Typing Challenge</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Typing Challenge]</strong> is an addictive arcade typing challenge designed to push your <strong>typing accuracy, reaction speed, and multitasking abilities</strong> to their absolute limit. Type swiftly and accurately to climb the global leaderboards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>1. Normal Mode: Test Your Split-Focus Skills</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Normal Mode serves as the ultimate test of your <strong>independent two-hand typing skills</strong>. Two separate lanes appear on the screen, and you must simultaneously and instantly type the characters descending in both lanes.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dual-Lane System</strong>: The <strong>left lane</strong> features characters found on the left side of the keyboard. The <strong>right lane</strong> features characters from the right side of the keyboard.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Over Condition</strong>: The game ends immediately if you fail to type the characters in <strong>even a single lane</strong>, allowing them to reach the bottom of the screen.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Difficulty Escalation</strong>: As the level progresses, both the <strong>number of characters</strong> and the <strong>speed</strong> at which they appear increase dramatically.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Challenge</strong>: See how high you can score by combining <strong>typing precision</strong>, <strong>raw speed</strong>, and superior <strong>multitasking ability</strong> to manage both simultaneous threats.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>2. Snake Mode: Precision and Stamina</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Snake Mode introduces a unique typing experience where characters are <strong>respawned sequentially, much like a crawling snake</strong>. Maintaining a clean, fast typing flow is paramount in this intense mode.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Continuous Respawn</strong>: Characters are linked and continuously respawn, requiring you to maintain an unbroken typing stream.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scaling Density</strong>: As the level advances, the <strong>size and total count of the character chains</strong> significantly increase, quickly overwhelming the screen.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Ultimate Test</strong>: Push your ability to maintain <strong>precise and rapid typing pace</strong> and test how long you can sustain that level of <strong>focus and stamina</strong>.</p></li></ul>",
        "short_description": "The game rule is simple. Type the words faster than they respawn.",
